TITLE Calcite kinetic dissolution in acidic Cu-Ba solution at 200C

SOLUTION 1
    temp      200
    pH        2.0
    pe        4.0
    units     mmol/kgw
    Cu        10.0
    Ba        5.0
    -water    1.0  # kg

KINETICS 1
Calcite
    -tol    1e-8
    -m0     1.0
    -m      1.0
    -parms  1.0  0.6
    -step   10 in 100

INCREMENTAL_REACTIONS true

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file   calcite_kinetics.out
    -reset  false
    -step   true
    -time   true
    -totals C Cu Ba Ca
    -molalities CO3-2 HCO3- H2CO3 CO2 Cu+2 CuOH+ Cu(OH)2 CuCO3

END
